8,59,83,23]],"links":[["Pierce County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/pierce-county"],["ARC or PLC in Pierce County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/pierce-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Pierce County has a PRF record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025 that middle ran 22% of normal for January to February and 155% for October to November. In 2026 so far, April to May came in at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
